{"path":"numeric/random/binomial_distribution/param","title":"std::binomial_distribution<IntType>::param","titleHtml":"<span class=\"t-title-prefix\">std::binomial_distribution&lt;IntType&gt;::</span>param","originalUrl":"https://en.cppreference.com/w/cpp/numeric/random/binomial_distribution/param","section":"numeric","kind":"page","summary":"Manages the associated distribution parameter set.","html":"<table class=\"t-dcl-begin\"><tbody>\n<tr class=\"t-dcl t-since-cxx11\" id=\"Version_1\">\n<td> <div><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">param_type param<span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span> <span class=\"kw4\">const</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span></span></div></td>\n<td> (1) </td>\n<td> <span class=\"t-mark-rev t-since-cxx11\">(since C++11)</span> </td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dcl t-since-cxx11\" id=\"Version_2\">\n<td> <div><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"kw4\">void</span> param<span class=\"br0\">(</span> <span class=\"kw4\">const</span> param_type<span class=\"sy3\">&amp;</span> params <span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span></span></div></td>\n<td> (2) </td>\n<td> <span class=\"t-mark-rev t-since-cxx11\">(since C++11)</span> </td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dcl-sep\"><td></td><td></td><td></td></tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>Manages the associated distribution parameter set.\n</p>\n<div class=\"t-li1\"><span class=\"t-li\">1)</span> Returns the associated parameter set.</div>\n<div class=\"t-li1\"><span class=\"t-li\">2)</span> Sets the associated parameter set to <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">params</span></code>.</div>\n<h3 id=\"Parameters\">Parameters</h3>\n<table class=\"t-par-begin\">\n<tr class=\"t-par\">\n<td> params\n</td>\n<td> -\n</td>\n<td> new contents of the associated parameter set\n</td></tr></table>\n<h3 id=\"Return_value\">Return value</h3>\n<div class=\"t-li1\"><span class=\"t-li\">1)</span> The associated parameter set.</div>\n<div class=\"t-li1\"><span class=\"t-li\">2)</span> (none)</div>\n<h3 id=\"Complexity\">Complexity</h3>\n<p>Constant.\n</p>\n<h3 id=\"Example\">Example</h3>\n<div class=\"t-example\">\n<pre data-lang=\"cpp\"><code><span class=\"co2\">#include &lt;iostream&gt;</span>\n<span class=\"co2\">#include &lt;random&gt;</span>\n&nbsp;\n<span class=\"kw4\">int</span> main<span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span>\n<span class=\"br0\">{</span>\n    <a href=\"/w/cpp/numeric/random/random_device\"><span class=\"kw1495\">std::<span class=\"me2\">random_device</span></span></a> rd<span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n    <a href=\"/w/cpp/numeric/random/mersenne_twister_engine\"><span class=\"kw1498\">std::<span class=\"me2\">mt19937</span></span></a> gen<span class=\"br0\">(</span>rd<span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n    <span class=\"kw1\">using</span> BinomialDist <span class=\"sy1\">=</span> <a href=\"/w/cpp/numeric/random/binomial_distribution\"><span class=\"kw1516\">std::<span class=\"me2\">binomial_distribution</span></span></a><span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&gt;</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n    BinomialDist bino_dis<span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"nu0\">1</span>, <span class=\"nu16\">0.5</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n&nbsp;\n    <a href=\"/w/cpp/io/cout\"><span class=\"kw1775\">std::<span class=\"me2\">cout</span></span></a> <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> <span class=\"st0\">\"A sample of Binomial(  1, 0.5): \"</span> <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> bino_dis<span class=\"br0\">(</span>gen<span class=\"br0\">)</span> <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> <span class=\"st0\">'<span class=\"es1\">\\n</span>'</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n&nbsp;\n    <span class=\"co1\">// Use another parameter set</span>\n    bino_dis.<span class=\"me1\">param</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span>BinomialDist<span class=\"sy4\">::</span><span class=\"me2\">param_type</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"nu0\">100</span>,<span class=\"nu16\">0.9</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n    <a href=\"/w/cpp/io/cout\"><span class=\"kw1775\">std::<span class=\"me2\">cout</span></span></a> <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> <span class=\"st0\">\"A sample of Binomial(100, 0.9): \"</span> <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> bino_dis<span class=\"br0\">(</span>gen<span class=\"br0\">)</span> <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> <span class=\"st0\">'<span class=\"es1\">\\n</span>'</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n<span class=\"br0\">}</span></code></pre>\n<p>Possible output:\n</p>\n<pre data-output=\"1\"><code>A sample of Binomial(  1, 0.5): 0\nA sample of Binomial(100, 0.9): 94</code></pre> \n</div>","headings":[{"depth":3,"text":"Parameters","id":"Parameters"},{"depth":3,"text":"Return value","id":"Return_value"},{"depth":3,"text":"Complexity","id":"Complexity"},{"depth":3,"text":"Example","id":"Example"}],"breadcrumbs":[{"path":"","title":"C++ reference"},{"path":"numeric","title":"Numerics library"},{"path":"numeric/random","title":"Pseudo-random number generation"},{"path":"numeric/random/binomial_distribution","title":"std::binomial_distribution"}],"children":[],"map":{"label":"std::binomial_distribution<IntType>::param","children":[{"label":"Declarations","note":"2 declarations; revisions: since C++11. Manages the associated distribution parameter set."},{"label":"Parameters","note":"params"},{"label":"Return value","note":"The associated parameter set."},{"label":"Complexity","note":"Constant."},{"label":"Example"}]},"standards":["C++11"],"wordCount":122,"codeBlockCount":2}
